    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Aimoto Rinku, who has a habit of saying \"Happy Around!\", has moved back to Japan from abroad, where she transfers to Yoba Academy where DJing is popular. She is deeply moved by a DJ concert she sees there, and decides to form a unit of her own with Akashi Maho, Oonaruto Muni, and Togetsu Rei. While interacting with the other DJ units like Peaky P-key and Photon Maiden, Rinku and her friends aim for the high stage!",
        "jpn": "TVアニメ「D4DJ First Mix」アニメティザーサイトを公開\r\nアニメは2020年秋放送開始予定\r\nアニメティザーサイトはこちら"
    },
