            "# Episodes": 13,
            "Episodes": {
                "1": {
                    "ID": "7953030",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/7953030",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "First Mix",
                        "jpn": "First Mix"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Rinku Aimoto, transfer student to Yoba Academy, meets DJ-in-training Maho Akashi. Seeing that Rinku is interested in DJ activities, Maho takes her to see the performance of the most popular DJ unit in the school, Peaky P-key. Consumed by the excitement of the performance, Rinku asks Maho to form a DJ unit with her.",
                        "jpn": "DJ活動が盛んな陽葉学園に転校してきた愛本りんくは、校内放送で流れてきた曲をきっかけにDJを志す明石真秀と出会う。真秀はDJ活動に興味を持つりんくを、学園トップの人気DJユニットPeaky P-keyのライブに連れて行く。そのフロアの熱気に押され、りんくは真秀と一緒にDJ活動をやりたいと想いを告げる。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "2": {
                    "ID": "8010810",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8010810",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Next Step",
                        "jpn": "Next Step"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Having formed a DJ unit with Rinku, Maho decides to host their first school concert. However, they are unable to attract the other students' attention. Looking for a way to change the situation, Maho comes across a school remix contest and decides to apply. She works all night and creates a remix that Rinku also likes, who then joins the contest alongside Maho. And the winner of the remix contest is...?!",
                        "jpn": "りんくとのDJ活動を決意した真秀は\r\n学内でのファーストライブの開催を決めるが、\r\nなかなか興味を持ってもらえず思い悩む。\r\nそんな中、学内でのリミックスコンテストを知り\r\n真秀は「これだ！」と応募をすることに。\r\n徹夜で仕上げたリミックスはりんくにも気に入られ、\r\nさっそく二人で応募する。その結果は……！？"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "3": {
                    "ID": "8010873",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8010873",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Only Me",
                        "jpn": "Only Me"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Muni Ohnaruto realises that Rinku is her childhood friend, but she is hesitant to talk to her. However, she comes across Rinku and Maho discussing flyer designs, and can't stop herself from meddling in. Rinku rejoices at the reunion and asks Muni, who is a talented illustrator, to be the VJ (Video Jockey) of the group.",
                        "jpn": "大鳴門むには話題の転校生が幼なじみのりんくであることに気づくが、なかなか話しかけることができない。そんな中、りんくと真秀がフライヤーのデザインで盛り上がっているところに鉢合わせ、うっかり口を出してしまう。りんくは再会を喜び、イラストが得意なむににＶＪ（ビジュアルジョッキー）として協力してほしいとお願いする。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "4": {
                    "ID": "8033593",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8033593",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Make My Song",
                        "jpn": "Make My Song"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Having welcomed Muni to the unit as VJ and gaining popularity through their concerts, Rinku and her friends decide to apply for a song composition contest. Rinku, who has started to practice piano for song making, introduces Teacher Rei-chan to Maho & Muni.",
                        "jpn": "むにがＶＪとして加わり、ライブも好評のりんくたちは新たな挑戦として楽曲コンテストへの応募をすることに。\r\n作曲のためにピアノを練習し始めたりんくは、ある日、真秀たちに「麗ちゃん先生」を紹介する。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "5": {
                    "ID": "8037701",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8037701",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "One and Only",
                        "jpn": "One and Only"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "To gain more attention, Muni says she wants to take part in singing as well. Rei begins to compose music themed after Muni, while Rinku suggests to Rei to have a pajama party at Muni’s house to deepen their friendship.",
                        "jpn": "もっと注目されるためにボーカルもやりたいと言い出したむに。\r\nそこで麗が「むにのイメージ」で作曲をすることに。\r\nりんくの提案で、親睦を深めるため麗はむにの家へお泊まりに行く。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "6": {
                    "ID": "8070557",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8070557",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Fall Camp",
                        "jpn": "Fall Camp"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Happy Around! has been formed at last! It seems everything is going smoothly for their DJ activities... but suddenly the final exams stand in Rinku, Muni, and Rei's path. To get them out of this crisis, Maho cooks curry...?!",
                        "jpn": "ついにハピアラ結成！　DJ活動も絶好調……と思いきや、 りんく、むに、麗の前に期末テストという強敵が立ちはだかる。 このピンチを切り抜けるために真秀はカレーを作る！？"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "7": {
                    "ID": "8070561",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8070561",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Holy Gifts",
                        "jpn": "Holy Gifts"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Happy Around! is preparing to hold a Christmas Event, but they are unable to book a concert hall on Christmas Eve. Rinku is deeply shocked, but Kyoko Yamate from Peaky P-key appears and...",
                        "jpn": "クリスマスイベントに向けて準備を始めるHappy Around!だったが、\r\nライブスペースの抽選からハズれてしまい、りんくは意気消沈。\r\nそこにPeaky P-keyの山手響子が現れ……。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "8": {
                    "ID": "8070564",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8070564",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Dear Friend",
                        "jpn": "Dear Friend"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Rinku's guest performance at Peaky P-key's Christmas Concert was well received, and she is very excited about the results. Seeing her joy, Maho becomes anxious and consults Shinobu Inuyose about the thoughts bothering her.",
                        "jpn": "Peaky P-keyのクリパライブに飛び入り参加したりんく。\r\n評判は上々で、りんく自身も気分上々。\r\nその様子に不安を抱く真秀は、犬寄しのぶにある相談をする。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "9": {
                    "ID": "8070566",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8070566",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Encounter With Light",
                        "jpn": "Encounter With Light"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Happy Around! places 8th in the Yoba Academy DJ rankings! However, the famous Photon Maiden has tied with them for 8th place. The two units face off to decide who will perform on the Sunset Stage.",
                        "jpn": "Happy Around!が陽葉学園の校内ランキングベスト８に！ 喜びも束の間、あのPhoton Maidenも同じくベスト８となり、 両者はサンセットステージ出場を賭けて一騎打ちとなる。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "10": {
                    "ID": "8104012",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8104012",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Brand New World",
                        "jpn": "Brand New World"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Photon Maiden awes the audience with their overwhelming performance. Happy Around! faces off with a new song which, following Rinku's idea, introduces Rei as the main vocal.",
                        "jpn": "圧倒的なパフォーマンスを見せるPhoton Maiden。 対するHappy Around!の新曲は、りんくの提案で 麗がメインボーカルに挑戦することに……！？"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "11": {
                    "ID": "8104016",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8104016",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Voice of Evolution",
                        "jpn": "Voice of Evolution"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Having seen a new color in Happy Around!'s performance, Saki starts to explore if they too have new colors of their own. Thus, Photon Maiden encounters a light that they have never experienced before.",
                        "jpn": "Happy Around!のライブに新しい色を見た咲姫は、自分たちにも新しい色があるのではと模索し始める。 そして、Photon Maidenはまだ見ぬ光に触れる。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "12": {
                    "ID": "8104019",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8104019",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Childhood Friends",
                        "jpn": "Childhood Friends"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "With Rinku's idea, Happy Around! Decides to try rap.\r\nUnder such circumstances, a passing occurs between Rinku and Muni.\r\nAiri gives drastic advice to Masahide and Rei who are worried.",
                        "jpn": "りんくの思いつきでHappy Around!はラップに挑戦することに。\r\nそんななか、りんくとむにの間にすれ違いが生じてしまう。\r\n心配する真秀と麗に、愛莉は思い切ったアドバイスをする。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "13": {
                    "ID": "8145554",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/d4dj-first-mix/episodes/8145554",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Groovy Mix",
                        "jpn": "Groovy Mix"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Happy Around is pitted against Peaky P-Key at the Sunset Stage.",
                        "jpn": "夢にまで見たサンセットステージ。\r\nりんくたちHappy Around!は、 あの絶対王者と対決することに……!!"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                }
            }
        },
